      "text": [
        "5869 - وَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : \"قَالَ اَللَّهُ جَلَّ جَلاَلُهُ \"أَيُّمَا عَبْدٍ أَطَاعَنِي لَمْ أَكِلْهُ إِلَى غَيْرِي وَ أَيُّمَا عَبْدٍ عَصَانِي وَكَلْتُهُ إِلَى نَفْسِهِ ثُمَّ لَمْ أُبَالِ فِي أَيِّ وَادٍ هَلَكَ\" \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5869 - Messenger of Allah (swt), peace and blessings be upon him and his family, said:\n\"Allah (swt), the Glorified and Exalted, said:\n'Whoever of My (swt) servants obeys Me (swt), I will not entrust him to anyone other than Myself (swt). And whoever disobeys Me (swt), I will leave him to himself, and I will not care in which valley he perishes.'\""
        ]
      }
